      "en": "They cast lots for their offices, all alike, the small as well as the great, the teacher as well as the student.",
      "ko": "이 무리의 큰 자나 작은 자나 스승이나 제자를 무론하고 일례로 제비 뽑아 직임을 얻었으니",
      "source_text_hash": "8003fa91990ff2c598ed7e88adddaa91ec0720e7f39c0ab831cce37fc05d87a5",
      "translation_text_hash": "fcd2b8e6e9c07762301744144d2b660dd9917dc33177d3f9d6bf8b13cef512d8",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
